1386	We proceed to show the cutflow Table~\ref{tab:HadCutflow}. For the purpose of illustration, we present a benchmark parameter point of \mbox{$M_{V_1} = 1.5 \TeV$} and \mbox{$c_t=2.0$}. We show the resulting backgrounds and signal cross sections in fb after each of the selection steps, together with the related significance that has been calculated for a luminosity of 3000~fb$^{-1}$.
